-- When the policyholder ends it: from the day Tasco receives the notice, 70% of the premium
-- before tax for the time left; nothing if an insured event has happened.
@ref Article 3.2.2 (src 237-239, 269-271)
GIVEN `the policy`                          IS A `A policy`
      `the date Tasco received the notice`  IS A DATE
      `an insured event has happened`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 3.2.2 — the refund when the policyholder ends` `the policy` `by notice received on` `the date Tasco received the notice` `, an insured event having happened:` `an insured event has happened` MEANS
    IF   `an insured event has happened`
    THEN 0
    ELSE 70% TIMES `the policy`'s `premium before tax`
             TIMES `the fraction of the period of` `the policy` `left after` `the date Tasco received the notice`

-- src:273 | Trường hợp Bảo hiểm Tasco chấm dứt hợp đồng bảo hiểm/ GCNBH, Bảo hiểm Tasco
-- src:274 | phải thông báo bằng văn bản cho Bên mua bảo hiểm/ Chủ xe. Bảo hiểm Tasco phải hoàn
-- src:275 | lại 100% phí bảo hiểm trước thuế cho Bên mua bảo hiểm/ Chủ xe tương ứng với thời gian
-- src:276 | còn lại của hợp đồng bảo hiểm/ GCNBH kể từ thời điểm phát hành thông báo.
-- When Tasco ends it: 100% of the premium before tax for the time left from the issue of the
-- notice. The text gives no exception for an insured event that has already happened (finding
-- X-12 notes the asymmetry with 3.1 and 3.2.2).
@ref Article 3.2.3 (src 273-276)
GIVEN `the policy`                       IS A `A policy`
      `the date Tasco issued the notice` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 3.2.3 — the refund when Tasco ends` `the policy` `by notice issued on` `the date Tasco issued the notice` MEANS
    100% TIMES `the policy`'s `premium before tax`
         TIMES `the fraction of the period of` `the policy` `left after` `the date Tasco issued the notice`

