§§§ `4.1 — Tasco's rights`

-- Src 278-295, not quoted. (1.1) to (1.4) and (1.7) are rights whose exercise this encoding does not model. (1.5), the
-- right to refuse a loss outside the cover or within an exclusion, and (1.6), the right to reduce
