-- src:309 | hiểm Tasco phải chủ động tiến hành xác minh và xem xét giải quyết bồi thường trên cơ
-- src:312 | sở tài liệu, chứng cứ thu thập được.
-- Where Tasco lacks the power to verify part of the file, the file is complete and valid only
-- when the competent authority concludes. If 90 days pass after Tasco's written request with no
-- result, Tasco must verify on its own and consider the claim. The text sets no time for that
-- verification, and the 15 or 30 days of 4.2.4 run only from a complete file (finding X-01).
@ref Article 4.2.5 (src 304-312; "90" read from PDF page 7)
GIVEN `the file` IS A `A claim file`
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 4.2.5 — the day from which Tasco must verify the file itself` `the file` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the file`'s `date Tasco asked the authority to verify`
    WHEN JUST d  THEN d PLUS 90
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `Tasco has not asked an authority to verify, so Article 4.2.5 has not begun to run`

@ref Article 4.2.5
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Tasco has not asked an authority to verify, so Article 4.2.5 has not begun to run` MEANS
    REFUSE "Tasco has not asked an authority to verify, so Article 4.2.5 has not begun to run"

