-- src:452 | xe phải trả chỉ phí giám định độc lập. Trường hợp khởi kiện tại Tòa án, các chi phí liên
-- src:453 | quan thực hiện theo phán quyết của Tòa án.
-- If the parties disagree, they may agree an independent assessor, or the policyholder may sue.
-- The independent assessor's fee falls on Tasco if the conclusion differs from Tasco's, and on the
-- policyholder if it is the same; in court, as the judgment decides.
DECLARE `Who bears the independent assessor's fee` IS ONE OF
    `Tasco bears it`
    `the policyholder bears it`
    `as the court's judgment decides`

@ref Article 6.3 (src 449-453)
GIVEN `the dispute went to court`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the independent conclusion is the same as Tasco's assessment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Who bears the independent assessor's fee`
`Article 6.3 — who bears the independent assessor's fee` `the dispute went to court` `the independent conclusion is the same as Tasco's assessment` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the dispute went to court`                                    THEN `as the court's judgment decides`
           IF `the independent conclusion is the same as Tasco's assessment` THEN `the policyholder bears it`
           OTHERWISE                                                              `Tasco bears it`

